Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:06:01.17,Note,,0,0,0,,(上传至星际联邦数据库)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:37.59,Note,,0,0,0,,(公共传送器)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:06.12,Note,,0,0,0,,(史巴克大使 联邦大使  联邦星舰企业号-二副 联邦星舰企业号A-大副)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:35.94,Note,,0,0,0,,(星际联邦)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:17.28,Note,,0,0,0,,搞定了 克劳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:20.11,Note,,0,0,0,,亚布罗讷到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.70,0:22:23.02,Note,,0,0,0,,攻下这艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.15,0:23:11.53,Note,,0,0,0,,(状态危急)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.67,0:24:47.96,Note,,0,0,0,,克劳  船掉头了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.88,0:24:51.42,Note,,0,0,0,,切断它的喉咙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.92,0:29:40.42,Note,,0,0,0,,(碟形母舰分离  请确认)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.35,0:35:28.64,Note,,0,0,0,,我们正在找舰长
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.03,0:44:49.03,Note,,0,0,0,,(联邦星舰富兰克林号)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.12,0:44:51.41,Note,,0,0,0,,(舰籍编号NX326)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.57,1:05:33.70,Note,,0,0,0,,找遍了残骸都没有 一定藏在别处
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.11,1:05:40.04,Note,,0,0,0,,我们手上只有他的舰员 克劳
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.32,1:15:57.11,Note,,0,0,0,,他们交给我处理
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.15,1:15:59.15,Note,,0,0,0,,你带领我们到了这一步
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.20,1:16:01.36,Note,,0,0,0,,完成任务吧 克劳
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.32,1:18:29.79,Note,,0,0,0,,你会死在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.39,1:18:32.06,Note,,0,0,0,,就跟你父亲一样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.25,1:20:20.29,Note,,0,0,0,,你要被丢下了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.63,1:22:35.63,Note,,0,0,0,,(联邦星舰富兰克林号)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.23,1:24:57.94,Note,,0,0,0,,(撞击距离)
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.08,1:48:02.24,Note,,0,0,0,,(巴尔萨泽·爱迪生 结案)
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.38,1:49:00.68,Note,,0,0,0,,(史巴克大使个人物品)
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.16,1:52:54.75,Note,,0,0,0,,(联邦星舰企业号)
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.35,1:55:24.65,Note,,0,0,0,,《星际迷航：超越星辰》
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.44,1:55:34.45,Note,,0,0,0,,[纪念亲爱的连纳·尼莫]
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.12,1:55:39.79,Note,,0,0,0,,[献给安东]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我是詹姆斯·提比略·柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Captain James Tiberius Kirk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,星际联邦的舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the United Federation of Planets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我谨以弗比安共和国的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am appearing before you as a neutral representative{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,中立代表身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the Fibonan Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,传达我方的善意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bring you a message of goodwill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,并为在场尊贵的提纳奇代表团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and present to you esteemed members of the Teenaxi Delegation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,献上来自弗比安最高议会的礼物 以示最诚挚的敬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a gift from the Fibonan High Council with the highest regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那个东西有问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.44,0:01:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为什么不想要了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't they want it anymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 就是 它曾是古代兵器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, well, this was once a piece of an ancient weapon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:01:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,现在则是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now they offer it as a symbol of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,和平的象征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,对弗比安人来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the Fibonan culture,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,呈上武器代表休兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to surrender a weapon is an offer of truce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎么得到这东西的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did they come by it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很早之前就有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They told me they acquired it a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,所以是偷来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they stole it, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they, um... Well, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们比你了解弗比安人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know the Fibonans like we do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 阁下 这份礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's very true. Your Excellency, this gift...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是一群不值得信任的小偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a crowd of untrustworthy thieves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,恨不得我们死在自家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who want to see us murdered in our own beds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这个珍贵的文物是信任与和平的象征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This beloved artifact is a symbol of trust and peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想把我们碎尸万段 放在火上烤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want to chop us into pieces and roast us over a fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no... I don't think that's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把我们吃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And eat us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 把我传送回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty! Get me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这么快 - 斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was quick. - Scotty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,地表有不少干扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's quite a bit of surface interference, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.36,0:03:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我的制服又破了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ripped my shirt again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,进展还顺利吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 提纳奇人愿意签条约了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, did you manage to broker a treaty with the Teenaxi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.04,0:03:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 就差那么一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... Let's just say I came up short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you, uh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我归档然后放回保管室 史巴克？谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}log that and put it in the vault, Spock? Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,吉姆 你气色糟透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, you look like crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 老骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你的太阳穴又爆青筋了 没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got that little vein popping out of your temple again. You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好到不行 今天跟平常没两样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never better! Just another day in the fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:04:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长日志 星历2263.2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's Log, Stardate 2263.2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是进行太空任务的第966天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today is our 966th day in deep space,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,五年任务过了也快三年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little under three years into our five-year mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在外层空间待愈久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more time we spend out here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,愈搞不清楚今天会什么时候结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the harder it is to tell where one day ends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,明天又会什么时候开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the next one begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要脚踏实地过日子很难 因为连重力都是人造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can be a challenge to feel grounded when even gravity is artificial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们尽可能让星舰像在家一样自在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, well, we do what we can to make it feel like home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,舰员们一如往常表现优异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crew, as always, continues to act admirably{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然他们必须在外层空间度过漫漫长日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}despite the rigors of our extended stay here in outer space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,并做出个人牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the personal sacrifices they have made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们持续搜寻新的物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We continue to search for new life forms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,以建立稳固邦交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to establish firm diplomatic ties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在未知领域长期探索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our extended time in uncharted territory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让机械设备承受极大负担\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has stretched the ship's mechanical capacities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,幸亏轮机室有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But fortunately our engineering department,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特坐镇 让问题迎刃而解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}led by Mr. Scott, is more than up to the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,除了船本身 长时间的共处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship aside, prolonged cohabitation has{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也对舰员之间的关系产生了影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}definitely had effects on interpersonal dynamics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有的经验很美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some experiences for the better,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有的下场凄惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and some for the worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说 这一切开始变得好像难以捉摸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As for me, things have started to feel a little episodic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们航行得愈远 我就愈怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The farther out we go, the more I find myself wondering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这么做的目的到底是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what it is we're trying to accomplish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果宇宙无穷无尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the universe is truly endless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是否永远追寻不到我们的目标？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then are we not striving for something forever out of reach?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,企业号预计在联邦最先进的新基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise is scheduled for a reprovisioning stop at Yorktown,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,约克镇做短暂停留并进行补给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Federation's newest and most advanced starbase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,或许短暂的休息能让我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps a break from routine will offer up some respite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时脱离未知的神秘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the mysteries of the unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我来迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,昆塞尔因为感冒在流某种 强酸性的绿色黏液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keenser's leaking some kind of highly acidic green goo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,而斯科特 很怕他的鼻涕会喷到 曲速核上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Scotty's terrified he's gonna sneeze on the warp core{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那会要了我们的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and kill us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你在喝什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you drinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就是上次在色索斯拿到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I'm pretty sure it's the rest of that Saurian brandy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,萨乌里白兰地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we picked up on Thasus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 你想喝瞎掉吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, man, are you trying to go blind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这酒是非法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That stuff's illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我在契科夫的柜子里找到好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found this in Chekov's locker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 厉害吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wow. - Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道他爱喝伏特加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I always assumed he'd be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 喝伏特加的好手 一点儿没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- a vodka man. - A vodka guy, exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我想好好庆祝你的生日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to have something appropriate for your birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 还有几天才到 你知道我不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, that's in a couple days. You know I don't care about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 你不喜欢在生日当天庆祝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I know you don't like celebrating it on the day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,因为同一天也是你爸的忌日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it's also the day your pa bit the dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我的神经还算敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was being sensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,医学院没教你要有礼貌？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did they teach you about bedside manner in medical school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们南部人就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just your southern charm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 真不是盖的 - 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, yeah. That's good. - Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,超棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lordy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你会打给你妈吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna call your mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我当天再打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, of course. I'll call her on the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我又老一岁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm one year older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是很自然的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep, that's usually how it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.00,0:07:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他永远也到不了我这个年纪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A year older than he ever got to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他加入星际舰队是因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He joined Starfleet because he...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,认同它的理念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He believed in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,而我是为了争一口气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I joined on a dare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你加入是想知道够不够格当他儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You joined to see if you could live up to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直以来都以父亲为榜样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, you spent all this time trying to be George Kirk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,现在却思考该怎么做自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now you're wondering just what it means to be Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you're out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,敬你完好的视力 还有浓密的头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To perfect eyesight and a full head of hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我是柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 约克镇基地快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, approaching Yorktown base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上过去 苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on my way, Mr. Sulu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我生日这件事别告诉任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's keep this birthday thing under wraps, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,安啦 我可是敏感先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you know me. Mr. Sensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 好惊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. That is impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 很美吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, she's a beauty, isn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这颗大球难看死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a damn monstrosity!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不能租个星球当基地吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't we just rent some space on a planet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,联邦若偏好某个星球的地理位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Showing geographical favoritism among inducted Federation worlds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可能导致外交情势紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could cause diplomatic tension.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就不紧张？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you don't think that looks tense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来就像一颗 随时会破掉的玻璃球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like a damn snow globe in space just waiting to break!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你老是嘴巴不饶人 老骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's the spirit, Bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有时间谈谈吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a moment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 娜尤塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, Nyota.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个应该还你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you should have this back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟是你母亲的遗物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, it belonged to your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们瓦肯人不习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not in the Vulcan custom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,把送出去的礼物再收回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to receive again that which was given as a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你们分手啦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys break up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你干了啥好事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一个典型的抽象提问 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A typically reductive inquiry, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克 你要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Spock,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如果一个地球女说"错在我 不在你"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if an Earth girl says, uh, "It's me, not you,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:10:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那么错的一定是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's definitely you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 史巴克中校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Commander Spock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.24,0:11:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可以占用您一点时间吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May we have a moment of your time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 我从没来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is wonderful! You know I've never been here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,听说这边的酒吧很赞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I hear is that the bars here are excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴你们能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so glad you guys could come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们告知我这个消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for bringing this to my attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,生生不息 繁荣昌盛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live long and prosper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,生生不息 繁荣昌盛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live long and prosper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有一艘来路不明的船舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}IFF alert on incoming vessel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来源不明 非联邦型号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unidentified. Non-Federation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,身分不明船舰请注意 你无权接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, unidentified vessel. You are not authorized for approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭引擎并等待进一步指示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power down and await instructions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,身分不明船舰 请遵守规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unidentified vessel, please comply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,正常说话即可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak normally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,语言分析完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Language analysis complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可以吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this working?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在星云里进行科学任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were on a science mission inside the nebula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的船突然失灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our ship suffered a critical malfunction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我躲进了逃生舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took an escape pod{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,接着船便坠毁在附近星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the ship crash landed on a nearby planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一艘能在星云里航行的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a ship capable of navigating the nebula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们之中一定有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,可以帮助我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who can help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们追踪了他们受困于 未知星云里的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tracked her stranded ship to a sector of uncharted nebula,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,位于210标14\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here at 2-1-0 mark 14.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 进行过长程扫描吗？- 没有数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh, long-range scan? - No data.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,星云密度太高了 那是一块未知区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nebula is too dense. It's uncharted space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,企业号拥有舰队最佳的 导航系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the Enterprise does have the best navigational system in the fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对可以胜任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She could handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这里唯一具备更先进科技的星舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only ship here with more advanced technology{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,还在建造当中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is still under construction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但我看重的不只是船本身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not just the ship that I'm sending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去召集舰员 - 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll gather the crew. - Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我从星舰司令部收到你的申请表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starfleet command sent me your application{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你想争取基地的中将职位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the Vice Admiral position here at this installation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 长官 呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am. Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的话 我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may, I would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,推荐史巴克中校代替我 成为企业号舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}recommend Commander Spock replace me as Captain of the Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他是星舰军官的典范 一定会是优秀舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is an exemplary Starfleet officer. He'd make a great captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 这不是什么稀奇的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't uncommon, you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:14:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even for a captain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也会有想离开的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to want to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在浩瀚无垠的太空中 没有相对的方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no relative direction in the vastness of space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is only yourself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你的星舰和舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your ship, your crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.48,0:15:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,迷失比想象中容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's easier than you think, to get lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是因为 - 这件事我会上呈到总议会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not about... - I'll bring it up with the General Council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,等你回来再讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll discuss it when you return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 史巴克 - 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Spock. - Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在想 - 或许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was thinking... - Perhaps there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 你讲吧 - 舰长 你先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, please. - Captain, after you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我坚持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I insist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这次任务结束后 我们应该坐下来谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After this mission, we should, uh, sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有件事我想跟你讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I need to talk to you about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有事想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I as well have something to share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们合作无间 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make a good team. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我坚持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I insist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,乌胡拉上尉 开启全舰广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Uhura, open a ship-wide channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,企业号舰员注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, crew of the Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们下一个任务是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our mission is straightforward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救一艘受困于未知星球上的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rescue a crew stranded on a planet in uncharted space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将进入一个不稳定的星云\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our trajectory will take us through an unstable nebula,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,失去与星际舰队的所有联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one which will disable all communications with Starfleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都得靠自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,企业号拥有其他星舰没有的优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise has something no other ship in the fleet has,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:16:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as we've come to understand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓的未知并不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no such thing as the unknown,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它们只是暂时隐藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only the temporarily hidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,通话完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 数据显示星云密度正在减少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm. Readings indicate cloud density diminishing, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这是阿塔密德星 我的船就是困在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Altamid. My ship is stranded here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,即将抵达M级行星 阿塔密德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approaching Altamid. Class-M planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,地下有巨大建设\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Massive subterranean development.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但地表没有物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But limited to no life forms on the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,近距离警报 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proximity alert, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.52,0:18:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有不明船舰朝我们过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an unknown ship heading right for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 乌胡拉上尉 呼叫对方 - 好的 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lieutenant Uhura, hail them. - Yes, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,无回应 我发现某种讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No response. I am picking up some kind of signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在干扰电波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're jamming us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,把影像放大 苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnify, Mr. Sulu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,开启防护罩 红色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields up! Red alert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.08,0:18:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,随意开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire at will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的光炮伤不了敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, our phasers are having minimal effect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼雷也追踪不了目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and our torpedos can't track their movements!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,火力全开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire everything we've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 我们的装备不足以交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we are not equipped for this manner of engagement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,防护罩频率没有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shield frequencies have no effect, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,偏导碟毁了 防护罩失灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took out the dish! Shields are inoperable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 启动曲速引擎 苏鲁 - 知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Warp us out of here, Mr. Sulu. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么没反应？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell aren't we moving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,无法启动曲速引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't engage the warp drive, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 让曲速引擎运作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, I need warp now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊 长官 因为引擎舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannae, sir! The nacelles, they've...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.04,0:20:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,安全人员 启动所有紧急程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security, engage all emergency procedures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.24,0:20:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,启动28号协定1A0警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Active protocol 28 Code One Alpha Zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人员就警戒位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel to alert stations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 第12至15层舰身遭到破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I have hull breaches in levels 12 to 15,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,还有第6 9 31和21层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}6, 9, 31 and 21, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.15,0:20:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 我可能可以把备用能源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain! There's a chance I can reroute the energy reserves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,从曲速核转移至脉冲引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the warp core to the impulse engines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,回到星云里 搞不好可以甩掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can get back into the nebula, maybe we could lose them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,尽你所能 斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do whatever you have to, Scotty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,小矮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wee man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,接上等离子导管 等我一声令下就移转 等离子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fit the plasma conduits and stand by to reroute on my mark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 舰长 - 请说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain. - Go, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了这场攻击行动的敌方领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have identified the individual who appears to be leading the attack party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.24,0:22:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他潜入保管室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He infiltrated the archive vault{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,拿走了提纳奇的文物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and removed the artifact from our mission on Teenax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.76,0:22:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,保持距离直到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your distance until...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.16,0:22:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们两个跟我来 苏鲁 接手指挥 - 遵命 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You two, with me. Sulu, you have the conn. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.41,0:23:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须马上撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, we must evacuate now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.04,0:24:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.72,0:24:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.72,0:24:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 脉冲引擎能量全满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! We are at 100% impulse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.84,0:24:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great work, Mr. Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.32,0:24:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,全速冲往星云\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maximum impulse towards the nebula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.16,0:24:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.72,0:25:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,柯克呼叫舰桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk to Bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.56,0:26:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去了惯性阻尼器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are losing the inertial dampeners!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.60,0:26:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,全舰系统正在失灵 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Systems are failing ship-wide, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.80,0:26:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,紧急闸门关闭中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency bulkheads are sealing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.32,0:26:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但结构完整性剩18% 而且不断往下掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but structural integrity is at 18% and falling, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.64,0:26:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,弃船逃生 苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon ship, Mr. Sulu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.84,0:26:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,启动警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sound the alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.80,0:26:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人员弃船逃生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon ship. All personnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,逃生舱要有机会逃出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to give those pods a chance to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把敌船引开吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you lead those ships away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.76,0:26:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,脉冲引擎仍试着从曲速储备取得能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impulse engines are still trying to draw power from the warp reserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.92,0:26:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要等到碟形母舰分离之后才能动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot move until the saucer is separated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.20,0:26:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.88,0:26:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye-aye, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.64,0:26:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,弃船逃生 所有人员立即撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon ship. All personnel evacuate immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.48,0:26:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧 天啊 把他扶起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay? Oh, my God. Get him up. Help him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.16,0:26:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,扶好你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.24,0:26:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,快点去逃生舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to get you guys to an escape pod. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.48,0:26:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快 丝尔少尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Ensign Syl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.00,0:26:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.40,0:26:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.68,0:27:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.40,0:27:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克 他们把舰员都抓走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, they're taking the crew!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.36,0:27:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,弃船逃生 所有人员 立即撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon ship. All personnel evacuate immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.44,0:28:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.60,0:28:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,碟形母舰怎么还没分离？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The saucer should be free by now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.64,0:28:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 苏鲁 舰长应该在那里才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, Mr. Sulu. The Captain should be there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人员立即撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel evacuate immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.72,0:30:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,脉冲引擎正在从辅助发电机取得能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impulse engines drawing power from auxiliary generators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.64,0:30:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.96,0:30:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还有多少人员在碟形母舰上？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many of the crew are still aboard the saucer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.32,0:30:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.84,0:30:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没有看错读数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I'm reading this correctly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.96,0:30:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那些入侵者带走了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the intruders are taking them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.92,0:30:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 我们被这个星球的重力拉住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we are caught in the planet's gravity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.60,0:30:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,无法离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot pull away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快去逃生舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to your Kelvin Pods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.76,0:30:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 遵命 - 好的 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. - Aye, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.44,0:30:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.20,0:30:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.28,0:31:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.16,0:33:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,契科夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chekov!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.48,0:33:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你早就知道我们会被攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew. You knew we'd be attacked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.28,0:33:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你不了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.72,0:33:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 柯克舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain! Captain Kirk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.32,0:33:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我说了谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的船遭到攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our ship was attacked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.00,0:33:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,契科夫 寻找生还者的踪迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chekov, check the comms for survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.36,0:33:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 舰长 - 他是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aye, Captain. - Who is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.84,0:33:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫克劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Krall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.52,0:33:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他带走了我的舰员 跟你的情况一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took my crew. Like he took yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.16,0:34:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么对企业号了如指掌？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did he know so much about the Enterprise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.88,0:34:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道如果照他的意思做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I know is that if I did this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.04,0:34:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他就会释放我的舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he would set them free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.64,0:34:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,契科夫 扫描仪有任何发现吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chekov, are you picking anything up on those scanners?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.56,0:34:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.72,0:34:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们会不会 - 不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What if they... - No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.64,0:34:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只是被带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was taking them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.36,0:34:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须找到碟形母舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to find that saucer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.76,0:34:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,上面的扫描系统范围比三度仪大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even minimal scanning systems will have more range than a tricorder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.24,0:34:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 舰长 你说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Captain, it's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.88,0:34:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.64,0:34:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我这么做是为了保护舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was protecting my crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.96,0:35:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.48,0:35:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会说我们的语言？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know our language?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.68,0:35:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.64,0:35:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我是联邦星舰企业号的 娜尤塔·乌胡拉上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Lieutenant Nyota Uhura of the U.S.S. Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.68,0:35:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你引发战争的行径已经触犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have committed an act of war against the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.36,0:35:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,星际联邦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.76,0:35:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,星际联邦专门引发战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federation is an act of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.40,0:35:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是你攻击我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You attacked us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.88,0:36:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your captain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.04,0:36:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么为他牺牲？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you sacrifice yourself for him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.12,0:36:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他也会做同样的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would have done the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.36,0:36:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他活下来 一定会来救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he made it off of that ship, he will come for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.12,0:36:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,正合我意 乌胡拉上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am counting on it, Lieutenant Uhura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.76,0:36:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真是有够衰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.36,0:37:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.52,0:37:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.28,0:37:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在这坐着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.44,0:37:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 坐下 慢慢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay, sit. Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.04,0:37:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.24,0:37:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量放轻松 你不会有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, just try and relax. You're gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.16,0:37:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你的声音透出勉强的乐观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The forced optimism in your voice suggests{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.12,0:37:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,显示你试着以冷静态度处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you are trying to elicit a sense of calm in order to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.36,0:37:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那就不用马粪哄你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll cut the horseshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.60,0:37:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不出来排泄物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, I fail to see how excrement of any kind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.16,0:37:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,与我们的当前状况有任何关联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bears relevance on our current situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.68,0:37:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 哇 你想干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, what the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.80,0:37:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须离开 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must keep moving, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.00,0:37:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿穿进了你的腹部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, this thing's punctured your iliac region!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.92,0:37:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,时间宝贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is a critical factor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.00,0:37:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what I'm trying to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.80,0:37:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,东西不取出来 你会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if I can't take this out, you're gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.84,0:37:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,东西取出来但血流不止 你也会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? If I take it out and can't stop the bleeding, you're gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.28,0:37:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,两个选项都不吸引人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see no appeal in either option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.24,0:37:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我也是这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe it or not, neither can I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.72,0:37:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.78,0:37:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我记得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I remember correctly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.44,0:37:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦肯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Vulcans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.45,0:37:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,心脏长在人类肝脏的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have their hearts where humans have their livers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.32,0:37:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is correct, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.52,0:38:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就说得通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That explains a thing or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.96,0:38:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你很走运 如果伤口再往左移个一吋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you're lucky. An inch to the left...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.52,0:38:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你早就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'd be dead already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.76,0:38:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我实在不懂 史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't get it, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.64,0:38:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们干嘛攻击我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what did they attack us for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.32,0:38:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了小不点们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, they do all this for some{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.44,0:38:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,都不要的那个玩意儿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doodad that the tiny critters didn't want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.72,0:38:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,把不了解的事过度简化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is unwise to trivialize{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.40,0:38:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,并非明智之举 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that which one simply does not understand, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.96,0:38:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能假设它不只是个"玩意儿"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can safely assume it is more important than a doodad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.88,0:38:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你刚刚侮辱了我两次吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you just managed to insult me twice, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.52,0:38:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.08,0:38:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克 我只有一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Spock, I just got one question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.48,0:38:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你最喜欢什么颜色？- 我看不出关联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your favorite color? - I fail to see the relevance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.36,0:38:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说出其不意比较不痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. They say it hurts less if it's a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.24,0:38:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,套用一句你熟悉的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may adopt a parlance with which you are familiar,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.60,0:39:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以肯定这个理论 马粪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can confirm your theory to be horseshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.52,0:39:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.60,0:39:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.28,0:39:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're kidding me, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.24,0:39:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.00,0:39:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫蒙哥马利·斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Montgomery Scott. And, uh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.69,0:39:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,请问你们是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who might you be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.76,0:39:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看着点 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it, sonny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.00,0:39:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我发起狠来也不是好惹的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm pretty handy when I want to be, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.41,0:40:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别再过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.76,0:40:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道我们的厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We certainly showed them, eh, lassie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.88,0:40:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那是星舰的东西 你不可以拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Starfleet property, okay. You cannae just take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.64,0:40:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但我今天特别大方 你要拿就拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, but I'm feeling generous today, so have at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.36,0:40:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那是哪里来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.12,0:40:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你会讲英文？- 我在家学的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that English? - I learn it from my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.00,0:40:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哪里来的？- 这是我的星舰徽章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where you get that? - It's my Starfleet insignia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.28,0:41:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,它代表什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.36,0:41:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,代表我是星舰军官 轮机组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means that I'm an officer of Starfleet. Uh, engineering division.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.16,0:41:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 轮机？- 对 修东西的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Engineering? - That's right. I fix things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.72,0:41:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道什么是轮机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what is engineering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.20,0:41:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟毁了我的船的那帮混蛋 不是一伙的吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not with those bastards that killed my ship, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.28,0:41:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看来应该不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take that as a no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.84,0:41:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人叫克劳 他跟他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is Krall. Him and his{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.42,0:41:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,蜜蜂们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.62,0:41:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在各个星球寻找死亡机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They search the stars for a death machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.16,0:41:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才会来到这里 我们才会都在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the reason why you here. Why we are all here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.84,0:41:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那三个恶煞也是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even those three scunners?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.76,0:41:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从天空掉下来 跟你我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have fallen from the sky, like me and you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.96,0:41:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.48,0:41:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 小姑娘 我今天过得很凄惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, no... Hang on a minute, lassie. I'm having a difficult day here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.76,0:41:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我还得找到我的舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to find my crewmates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.80,0:41:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我会帮你找到你的舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will help you find your mates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.04,0:41:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你要帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you will help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.56,0:41:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.36,0:41:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我修东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to fix something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.68,0:41:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你帮我 我也帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. You help me, and I help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.56,0:42:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,以目前情况看来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, well, things being as they are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.20,0:42:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没有更好的选择 带路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt I'll get a better offer today, so, lead the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.00,0:42:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.16,0:42:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫洁拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Jaylah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.84,0:42:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是蒙哥马利·斯科特 - 对 斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you are Montgomery Scott. - Aye, Scotty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.84,0:42:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来 蒙哥马利·斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come now, Montgomery Scotty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.96,0:42:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好 等等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.00,0:42:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是企业号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.64,0:42:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她可能 连舰桥的电力都无法供给 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She may not even have power to the Bridge, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.84,0:42:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她一定还能做些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She still has a few tricks up her sleeve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.44,0:42:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信她可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd bet on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.72,0:42:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,麦考伊呼叫企业号 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCoy to Enterprise. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.04,0:42:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,麦考伊呼叫企业号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCoy to Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.60,0:42:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来 史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, take it easy there, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.96,0:43:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你的伤口只是暂时缝合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was just a temporary fix back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.92,0:43:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.00,0:43:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,美得惊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.28,0:43:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不祥 黑暗 危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ominous. Dark. Dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.92,0:43:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们要进去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.28,0:43:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这些符号 在攻击中被夺走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intriguing. These symbols are the same as those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.36,0:43:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,文物上也有这些符号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}depicted on the artifact taken in the attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.40,0:43:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得它来自这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think it came from here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.20,0:43:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would seem so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.90,0:43:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.12,0:43:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy. Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.01,0:44:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.24,0:44:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到了没？- 别问个不停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are we there yet? - Stop asking that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.16,0:44:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 这边 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - This is the way. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.60,0:44:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,注意脚下 别踩到我设的陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And watch your steps. You do not want to set off my traps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.68,0:44:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,很聪明嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.80,0:44:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.96,0:44:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的房子 - 你的房子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is my house. - Your house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.04,0:44:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着 难道这是一艘船？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on a minute. Is this a ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.96,0:44:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你找朋友 你帮我修好它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I help you find your friends and you help me fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.56,0:44:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我就可以永远离开这个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I can leave this planet forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.19,0:44:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 这是你的船？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Is this your ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.32,0:44:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不 蒙哥马利·斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Montgomery Scotty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.64,0:44:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.24,0:44:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my good Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.84,0:44:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 看来还有电力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, it looks like there is power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.92,0:45:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们去舰桥才能找其他舰员的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's get to the Bridge and find the crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.84,0:45:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,控制台没有损坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The console is intact, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.56,0:45:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我会试着接上电力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will try to reroute power to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.20,0:45:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.40,0:45:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这里一亮会引来很多注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we get this place lit up, we're gonna draw a lot of attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.72,0:45:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你能找到他们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, can you find them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.32,0:45:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.48,0:45:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在重新配置扫描仪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am reconfiguring scanners{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.94,0:45:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,把目标设定成舰员的讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to modulate for the crew's signals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.20,0:46:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我来 我藏了个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're with me. I left something behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.56,0:46:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你的感冒还真严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is one heck of a cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.20,0:46:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 昆塞尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice job, Keenser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.20,0:46:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 下一轮守卫还有15分钟才会来 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we got about 15 minutes until the next guard rotation. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.04,0:46:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.72,0:46:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.40,0:46:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是麦哲伦号探测器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Magellan Probe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.88,0:46:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,联邦曾用它在星云里找路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Federation was using these to find a way through the nebula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.36,0:46:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳拿它做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he using it for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.92,0:47:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么发现？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.52,0:47:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他在探测器之间架设了亚空间通讯链接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been piggybacking the subspace links between the probes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.24,0:47:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能用它来发求救讯号吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we use it to send a distress signal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.49,0:47:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.88,0:47:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,送出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.08,0:47:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他能进入约克镇的数据库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's accessed the Yorktown database.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.32,0:47:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.88,0:47:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他有星舰数据文件 日志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got Starfleet data files, ship logs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.68,0:47:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,包括企业号的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including the Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.80,0:47:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直看着我们的一举一动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been watching us this whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.52,0:48:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.40,0:48:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那个武器一直都在这艘船上吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the artifact was on the ship the whole time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.48,0:48:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,带在身上太危险 所以我藏在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't afford to get caught with it, so I hid it in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.32,0:48:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉克劳我找到亚布罗讷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Krall I have the Abronath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.20,0:48:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,每个悲惨故事你都相信吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe every sad story you hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.79,0:48:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not every.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.00,0:48:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,放下光炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the phaser down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.24,0:48:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,请照做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.96,0:48:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪到了吧 契科夫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get it, Chekov?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.44,0:48:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 舰长 我查到了收话者的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Captain, I have traced the location of her call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.64,0:49:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳要这个东西做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does Krall want with this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.36,0:49:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,把你们从自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To save you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.92,0:49:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,解救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.56,0:49:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.36,0:49:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还好吧？- 没事 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right? - Aye, Captain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.80,0:49:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们被困住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we are trapped!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.44,0:50:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你能启动它吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you get this thing started?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.80,0:50:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是要使用推进器吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you intimating that we should engage the thrusters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.52,0:50:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你有别的建议吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am open to other suggestions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.16,0:50:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.48,0:50:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有个问题 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There is a problem. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.36,0:50:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,里头有燃料但我无法让它燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fuel is primed, but I cannot get it to combust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.56,0:50:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 我们可说是 站在一颗超大炸弹上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oy, Captain, we are basically standing on a very large bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.24,0:50:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你没打中压缩器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you miss the combustion compressor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.64,0:50:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我会打中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna miss, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.72,0:50:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道它长什么样子吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you even know what the combustion compressor looks like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.92,0:50:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,方方的 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's square, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.33,0:50:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是圆圆的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, it's round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.44,0:50:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚就是这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.80,0:50:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.96,0:50:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.48,0:51:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,契科夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chekov!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.20,0:51:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,契科夫 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chekov! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.24,0:53:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你们自以为知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.44,0:53:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,牺牲的意义是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what sacrifice really means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.92,0:53:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,星际联邦告诉你们 冲突不应该存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federation has taught you that conflict should not exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.92,0:53:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有了抗争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But without struggle,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.76,0:53:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远找不到真实的自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you would never know who you truly are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.40,0:53:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不了解我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea who we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.36,0:53:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但很快就能见真章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll soon find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.80,0:53:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你们刚才传送出去的求救讯号？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean the distress signal you thought you sent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.32,0:53:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你们改了坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The coordinates were altered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.48,0:53:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的救难舰会被困在星云里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your rescue ships will be stranded in the nebula{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.60,0:53:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,基地变得不堪一击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your base left vulnerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.96,0:53:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算攻击约克镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to attack Yorktown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.48,0:53:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,数百万来自星联各盟邦的人齐聚一堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millions of souls from every Federation world holding hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.04,0:54:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这目标再完美不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a perfect target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.32,0:54:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你错了 团结会带来力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wrong. There is strength in unity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.32,0:54:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他人的力量 上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The strength of others, Lieutenant,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.08,0:54:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是我生命的泉源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is what has kept me alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.00,0:54:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.28,0:54:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.52,0:54:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克 醒醒啊 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, wake up, damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.44,0:54:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意识完全清醒 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am entirely conscious, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.28,0:54:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在思考死亡的本质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm simply contemplating the nature of mortality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.20,0:54:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,开始在想人生哲理了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feeling philosophical, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.76,0:55:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是大量失血的后遗症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Massive blood loss will do that to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.80,0:55:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你问我为什么和乌胡拉上尉分道扬镳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You asked me why Lieutenant Uhura and I parted ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.72,0:55:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦肯星灭亡之后 我开始认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I became concerned, in the light of Vulcan's demise,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.76,0:55:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我对我的种族有一份责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I owed a debt of duty to my species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.92,0:55:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得你应该生瓦肯宝宝是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought you should be off making little Vulcans, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.64,0:55:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是了 难怪她会不开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I can see how that would upset her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.24,0:55:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本打算进一步跟她谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intended to discuss it with her further,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.16,0:55:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但我收到了令我措手不及的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I received some news which affected me unexpectedly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.92,0:55:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么消息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.92,0:55:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克大使过世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ambassador Spock has died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.68,0:55:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克 我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.76,0:55:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法想象那是什么感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't imagine what that must feel like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.44,0:56:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你像他活了那么多辈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you've lived as many lives as he,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.76,0:56:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,惧怕死亡是没有道理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fear of death is illogical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.36,0:56:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,惧怕死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear of death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.56,0:56:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是让我们活下来的动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is what keeps us alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.04,0:56:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我想过和他一样的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to live as he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.40,0:56:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,因此我决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why I decided{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.04,0:56:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,转移我的目标并延续他的遗志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to redirect my efforts and continue his work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.28,0:56:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在新瓦肯耕耘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on New Vulcan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.08,0:56:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你要离开星舰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're leaving Starfleet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.44,0:56:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,吉姆怎么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did Jim have to say about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.04,0:56:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我尚未找到时机告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could not find the time to tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.16,0:56:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我敢说他一定会大受打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I can tell you he's not gonna like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.00,0:56:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他没有你该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, I don't know what he'd do without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.40,0:57:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,反观我是会开派对庆祝啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, me on the other hand, I'd throw a party, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.72,0:57:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 你精神错乱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, you're getting delirious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.20,0:57:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们距离收话者的坐标还有多远？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far are we from the coordinates of that call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.00,0:57:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一段距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still a ways, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.96,0:57:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 舰长？- 何事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.00,0:57:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你是从什么时候开始怀疑她的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you begin to suspect her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.12,0:57:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.38,0:57:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么发现的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.24,0:57:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.88,0:57:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是因为我很容易察觉到危险吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you could say I've got a good nose for danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.92,0:57:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.08,0:57:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那是音乐吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that music?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.52,0:57:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪里来的音乐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where on earth is that coming from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.28,0:57:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.00,0:58:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我把那个小盒子插上电源后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I plugged the little box in the power cell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.08,0:58:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,它的小嘴巴就开始唱歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the little mouths make it sing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.44,0:58:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,很聪明嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.28,0:58:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这音乐对我来说有点老派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Music's a bit old-fashioned for my taste,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.08,0:58:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,很吵又令人分心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to mention very loud and distracting,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.76,0:58:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 还真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, aye, well played.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.44,0:58:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它的节拍和吼叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the beats and shouting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.36,0:58:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.96,0:58:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 关掉 - 不用啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Switch it off. - Ach, you're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.60,0:58:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.16,0:58:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有人踩到了我的陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone set off one of my traps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.92,0:58:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.76,0:58:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你认识这些人？- 是的 小姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know these men? - Aye, lassie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.76,0:58:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那小子是帕维·契科夫 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That wee man there is Pavel Chekov. - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.12,0:59:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,另一位帅哥是詹姆士·T·柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that handsome bastard is James T. Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.60,0:59:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是我的同伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're my mates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.92,0:59:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to see you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.00,0:59:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她要做什么 斯科特？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is she doing, Scotty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.92,0:59:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,别伤害他们 不可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hurt them. No, don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.72,0:59:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是打她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.12,0:59:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你自由了 詹姆士·T - 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're free, James T. - There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.72,0:59:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.60,0:59:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这位新朋友是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's your new friend here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.48,0:59:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好个待客之道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She sure knows how to throw out a welcome mat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.80,0:59:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是洁拉 - 我不知道什么是待客之道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is Jaylah. - I do not know what is a welcome mat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.96,0:59:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有发现其他人吗？- 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You find anybody else? - No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.56,0:59:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 只有你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, you're the only ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.04,0:59:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？我们为什么被攻击？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened up there, Jim? Why were we attacked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.36,0:59:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对方想要提纳奇的文物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were after the artifact we brought back from T eenax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.00,0:59:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们得手了吗？- 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did they get it? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.08,0:59:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你带在身上？- 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you got it? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.16,0:59:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经转移走了 我放在逃生舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to get it off the Enterprise, put it on a shuttle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.48,0:59:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你藏在逃生舱 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You hid it in a shuttle. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.96,0:59:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.04,1:00:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是联邦星舰富兰克林号 你相信吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the U. S. S. Franklin, sir. Can you believe it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.52,1:00:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,第一艘达到四级曲速的地球星舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First Earth ship capable of warp 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.84,1:00:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,2160年代早期在加加林辐射带失踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Went missing in the Gagarin Radiation Belt in the early 2160s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.00,1:00:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我在星舰学院读过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember that from the Academy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.48,1:00:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,巴尔萨泽·爱迪生舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Balthazar Edison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.40,1:00:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,星舰最早的英雄之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the first heroes of Starfleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.12,1:00:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他的船怎么会跑到这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did his ship end up here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.00,1:00:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多派说法 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a lot of theories, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.40,1:00:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,降服于罗慕兰人 被太空绿巨手抓走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surrendered to the Romulans. Captured by a giant green space hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.76,1:00:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但来到这么远的地方 一定是虫洞位移\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This far out, it's got to be a wormhole displacement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.08,1:00:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她能飞吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can she fly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.32,1:00:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她少了几个驱动器线圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's missing a few driver coils{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.88,1:00:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,少了几个电等离子系统导管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the EPS conduits are fried,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.36,1:00:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但 洁拉用她优秀的技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Jaylah has done a marvelous job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.48,1:00:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,让系统恢复了运作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of getting the ship's systems back online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.48,1:00:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 蒙哥马利·斯科特 - 借过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, Montgomery Scotty. - Pardon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.00,1:00:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,契科夫 输入坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Chekov, can you plug in the coordinates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.28,1:00:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,用这艘船的传感器追踪舰员位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if you can track the crew's location from the ship's sensors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.88,1:00:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.20,1:00:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他喜欢那张椅子 - 斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He likes that seat. - Mr. Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.12,1:00:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 介绍一下环境 - 我带你去看食堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tour. - Yes, the mess hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.84,1:00:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洁拉 麻烦你 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jaylah, if you will. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.20,1:01:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这些舰员后来怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No clue what happened to the crew, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.76,1:01:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 早就化为白骨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. They'd be dead a hundred years by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.40,1:01:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那该不会是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.24,1:01:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是PX70耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a PX70!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.68,1:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.56,1:01:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸小时候有一辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad used to have one when he was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.72,1:01:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈说她坐在后座总是吓个半死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom said he'd put her on the back of it, drive her nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.64,1:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.96,1:01:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你说这艘星舰在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're telling me this thing's been here this whole time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.48,1:01:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一直没有被发现？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and no one's ever noticed it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.00,1:02:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她架设了影像折射器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's rigged up image refractors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.12,1:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿 那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.40,1:02:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,类似全像伪装的装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, like some sort of holographic camouflage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.64,1:02:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.96,1:02:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.12,1:02:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我拦截到微弱通讯传输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have intercepted a weak communications transmission, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.40,1:02:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是星舰的频率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Starfleet frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.96,1:02:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你能加强讯号吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you lock on to the signal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.96,1:02:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 但要怎么过去找它们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but how do we get to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.00,1:02:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have an idea, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.80,1:02:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我需要你同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm gonna need your permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.80,1:02:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要征得我的同意？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you need my permission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.04,1:02:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,因为如果搞砸了 我不想一个人扛下责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if I mess it up, I don't want it to be just my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.36,1:02:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,麦考伊与史巴克呼叫企业号舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCoy and Spock to Enterprise crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.00,1:02:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,请回答 企业号舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, Enterprise crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.16,1:02:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.04,1:02:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.96,1:02:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来 你可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.80,1:02:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,把我留下来能 能显著增加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaving me behind will significantly increase{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.20,1:02:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你的幸存机率 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your chances of survival, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.00,1:02:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么说很有义气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's damn chivalrous of you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.36,1:02:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但我办不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but completely out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.60,1:03:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你的首要之务是找到存活的舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is imperative that you locate any surviving crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.88,1:03:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你是关心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here I was thinking you cared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.80,1:03:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然关心你 连纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I care, Leonard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.52,1:03:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你的尊重应该显而易见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always assumed my respect for you was clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.04,1:03:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,多年来我们之间的对话总是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dialogue we have had across the years has always...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.64,1:03:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了 史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.80,1:03:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必勉强自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.16,1:03:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我不会一个人死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at least I won't die alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.92,1:03:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道事情会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's just typical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.64,1:03:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you bastards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.64,1:03:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴看到你毫发无伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you in one piece, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.04,1:03:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.76,1:04:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得五脏六腑都移了位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like my innards have been to a barn dance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.08,1:04:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这些老旧传送器原本只送货物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, well, these old transporters were only ever used for cargo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.36,1:04:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们做了一些调整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a few modifications seem to do the trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.16,1:04:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得最好一次传送一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it best to beam you one at a time, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.28,1:04:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 以免你们 合而为一 - 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know, in case you got spliced. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.76,1:04:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那就再糟不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't imagine a worse scenario.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.96,1:04:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你能回来真好 没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to have you back. You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.40,1:04:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好 倒是他受伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm fine. He's hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.76,1:04:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我的身体运作正常 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am functioning adequately, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.72,1:04:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a pig's eye, you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.92,1:04:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发现被偷走的文物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we discovered that the stolen artifact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.26,1:04:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来自这颗行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}appears to have come from this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.60,1:04:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你就别再撑了 史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.56,1:04:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有医疗用品吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there any medical supplies on this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.24,1:04:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.00,1:04:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好 在这里躺着 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Lie down. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.10,1:04:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.76,1:04:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么度过这次危机 史巴克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we gonna get out of this one, Spock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.36,1:04:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没有船舰也没有船员 机会渺茫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got no ship, no crew. Not the best odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.76,1:04:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一如往常 吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will do what we have always done, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.40,1:04:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要在不可能中 寻找希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will find hope in the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.84,1:04:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,先把你包扎好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get you patched up first, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.32,1:04:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.72,1:04:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该专心拯救舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must focus your efforts on helping the crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.80,1:04:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才需要你在身边 史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's why I need you around, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.24,1:05:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这些设备老旧到不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things are from the dark ages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.12,1:05:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,老骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.48,1:05:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这看起来是愈合器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm pretty sure this is a protoplaser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.96,1:05:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,应该能止住内出血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should stop the internal hemorrhaging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.96,1:05:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,希望行得通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least that's my hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.56,1:05:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"不幸者唯一的解药便是希望"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The miserable have no other medicine But only hope."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.88,1:05:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,都快挂了 还在引用莎士比亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death's door and he's quoting Shakespeare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.12,1:05:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长日志 星历2262.18\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's Log, Stardate 2262.18.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.56,1:05:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,任务是例行搜查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mission, routine investigation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.12,1:05:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果宇宙真的浩瀚无垠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the universe is truly endless...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.68,1:05:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,两年前看似清楚的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What seemed so clear to me two years ago now seems,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.64,1:05:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在却变得遥不可及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.32,1:05:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我文物藏在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will tell me where it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.16,1:05:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.52,1:05:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.60,1:06:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他 我把东西给你就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go and I will give you what you want!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.44,1:06:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,丝尔 不可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Syl, don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.32,1:06:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,上尉 团结不是你们的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, unity is not your strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.00,1:06:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,而是弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is your weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.16,1:07:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该完全确定再行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should wait until we're absolutely sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.00,1:07:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们必须马上去救他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we have to get the crew back now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.12,1:07:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,契科夫已经有克劳基地的坐标 还等什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chekov has the coordinates that can lead us to Krall's base, so we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.08,1:07:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道我们怎么知道卡拉莱联络他的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With respect, sir, how do we know that Krall was at the base{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.44,1:07:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳就在基地？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when she called him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.60,1:07:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们也不知道船员在不在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if he was, we don't know that the crew is even with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.60,1:07:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定他们都还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or if they're even still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.64,1:07:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,契科夫 你能重新配置搜寻参数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Chekov, can you reconfigure the search parameters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.84,1:07:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来对这个公式进行补偿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to compensate for this formula?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.96,1:07:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 中校 但这是什么公式？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Commander, but what is this formula?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.32,1:07:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,沃卡亚的公式 契科夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is Vokaya, Mr. Chekov.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.92,1:07:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦肯特有的矿物 会发出低强度辐射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mineral unique to Vulcan which emits low-level radiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.00,1:07:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我来滤除其他能量放射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will have to filter out all other energy emissions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.92,1:07:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这种鬼地方怎么会有瓦肯矿物？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, what the hell would a Vulcan mineral be doing way out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.48,1:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你想做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.88,1:07:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,乌胡拉上尉戴着我以爱意与\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Uhura wears a Vokaya amulet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.76,1:07:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,尊重之名所送的沃卡亚项链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which I presented to her as a token of my affection and respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.20,1:07:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你送你女朋友具放射性的首饰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave your girlfriend radioactive jewelry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.40,1:07:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,它的辐射无害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The emission is harmless, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.80,1:08:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但特征很容易识别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But its unique signature makes it very easy to identify.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.72,1:08:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你送你女友一个追踪器？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave your girlfriend a tracking device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.64,1:08:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那并非我的本意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was not my intention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.36,1:08:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还好他不尊重我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad he doesn't respect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.32,1:08:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我侦测到非常微弱的沃卡亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am detecting a very trace amount of Vokaya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.24,1:08:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是否与你从卡拉莱那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does the location match the coordinates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.72,1:08:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,获得的坐标相匹配 契科夫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you acquired from Kalara, Mr. Chekov?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.88,1:08:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是一致的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a match, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.32,1:08:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这显示出乌胡拉上尉和其他舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its presence suggests that Lieutenant Uhura and thereby the rest of the crew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.12,1:08:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,都被扣留在克劳的基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are being held at Krall's base of operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.52,1:08:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把他们传送过来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you beam them out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.28,1:08:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 舰长 那里有地表干扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. There is some geological interference{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.96,1:08:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,会阻碍传送器讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is blocking the transporter signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.36,1:08:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我们只能去那边一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess we're gonna have to go in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.80,1:08:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,用最原始的方法把他们救出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and break them out the old-fashioned way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.40,1:08:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不能过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot go to this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.92,1:08:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,每个过去的人 都会被他杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone who goes there, he kills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.68,1:08:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你 你去过 也亲眼见过？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've... You've been there? You've seen it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.32,1:08:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不早说 小姑娘？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, why didn't you say something, lassie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.00,1:09:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我知道你们会叫我带路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I know you will ask me to take you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.28,1:09:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们的朋友在那里 他们就会死掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your friends are there, then they will die,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.44,1:09:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,如同我的家人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.12,1:09:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对不会回去那个死地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I will not go back to that death place!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但你逃得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, but if you've escaped,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.76,1:09:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,代表你知道进出的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you can show us the way in and the way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.60,1:09:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这跟当初谈的不一样 蒙哥马利·斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! This is not the deal we made, Montgomery Scotty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.84,1:09:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要去就自己去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you choose to do this, you are on your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.04,1:09:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.12,1:09:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,让她走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.28,1:09:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她也失去了亲人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's lost people, too, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.44,1:09:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的朋友在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, that's our friends out there, lassie. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.68,1:09:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannae just leave them behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.04,1:09:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很需要你的帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we could really use your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.24,1:09:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你鼓起勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just need you to be brave, is all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.24,1:09:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我和家人在那个地方的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we were in that place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.72,1:09:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳会来把某个人抓走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krall would come and take someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.64,1:09:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他们发出的惨叫声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were screams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.80,1:09:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我到现在还听得见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can still hear them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.88,1:09:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再也见不到那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we would not see that person again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.76,1:10:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个死的也不知道会是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did not know who would be next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.84,1:10:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲计划逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father planned an escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.18,1:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们被一个叫马纳斯的手下撞见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we were seen by the one they call Manas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.76,1:10:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲和他打起来 让我有机会逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father fought him so I could get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.32,1:10:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他很勇敢 但马纳斯杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was brave and Manas killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.84,1:10:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不可能成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you want is impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.84,1:10:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, maybe it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.44,1:10:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我奶奶曾说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. My wee granny used to say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.79,1:10:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"一捆树枝折不断"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Ya cannae break a stick in a bundle."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.48,1:10:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事牵扯的也益发严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're part of something bigger now, lassie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.32,1:10:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right? Dinnae give up on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.96,1:10:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们也不会放弃你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause we'll sure as hell never give up on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.00,1:10:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是身为舰员的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what being part of a crew is all about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.04,1:10:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是这么想的吗 詹姆士·T？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you believe in, James T.?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.00,1:10:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道有你帮忙 我们更有机会成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I know is we stand a better chance with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.00,1:11:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,挖掘的机器可以挖一个隧道 是通往坑地的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The digging machines uncovered a tunnel that goes into the crater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.92,1:11:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是从那里逃出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how I got out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.16,1:11:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就从那里进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that'll be our way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.92,1:11:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,外遣队传送到隧道另一头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An away team will beam to the other side of the tunnel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.04,1:11:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,进入克劳的基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}follow it to Krall's base,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.28,1:11:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,到建筑物里把舰员带出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get inside the building and break out the crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.76,1:11:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 坑洞里的人是没有办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Captain, we cannot lock onto anyone inside the crater{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.68,1:11:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,被传送回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to beam them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.92,1:11:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我能架设脉冲信标做为增强器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I could rig up pulse beacons as pattern enhancers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.16,1:11:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,把讯号从坑洞里传出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd get the signal out of the crater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.36,1:11:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 富兰克林号一次能传送多少人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - How many people can the Franklin transport at a time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.80,1:11:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,调整过后最多20人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, with a wee bit of modification, 20 max,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.12,1:11:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不确定能撑多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm not sure how long it would hold out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.04,1:11:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,老骨头 契科夫 洁拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones, Mr. Chekov, Jaylah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.36,1:11:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我是外遣队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're with me on the away team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.52,1:11:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 调整传送器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scott, modify that transporter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.44,1:11:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,然后尽你所能让这艘船运作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then do everything you can to get this ship operational.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.64,1:11:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 契科夫拥有的技术特长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, Mr. Chekov's technical acumen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.44,1:11:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,使得他与斯科特留在这星舰上更有价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}makes him more valuable aboard the Franklin with Mr. Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.28,1:11:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,由我来代替他合乎逻辑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is thereby logical that I would replace him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.64,1:11:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这样哪里合乎逻辑了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is that logical, Spock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.96,1:11:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你的伤口才刚愈合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just got back on your feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.84,1:11:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,乌胡拉上尉也在那里 吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Uhura is in that facility, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.40,1:11:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我会看着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll keep an eye on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.64,1:11:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.32,1:11:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可是到处都是克劳的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But his soldiers are everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.92,1:11:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定会被看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't pass unseen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.72,1:11:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要进行诱敌战术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we require is a diversion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.68,1:12:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I have an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.40,1:12:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是亚布罗讷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Abronath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.08,1:12:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,古住民用它当武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was used by the Ancient Ones as a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.36,1:12:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们控制不了这股致命力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when they could not control its deadly power,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.56,1:12:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,便把它分成两半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they split it into two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.92,1:12:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,发射至太空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ejected the halves into space,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.76,1:12:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,希望它永远消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hoping it would be lost forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.12,1:12:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但我很感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I am grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.88,1:12:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了一辈子的时间寻找它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have spent lifetimes searching for it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.24,1:13:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,最后由你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only to have you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.64,1:13:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,替我找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}find it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.41,1:13:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这是命运的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The poetry of fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.68,1:13:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的原生世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world that I was born into{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.96,1:13:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你的很不一样 上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is very different from yours, Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.16,1:13:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们活在痛苦和恐怖之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We knew pain. We knew terror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.92,1:13:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们变强的是斗争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Struggle made us strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.12,1:13:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是和平与团结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not peace. Not unity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.16,1:13:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是星际联邦灌输的迷思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are myths the Federation would have you believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.76,1:13:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得理直气壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are strong words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.88,1:13:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,也可能真的这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might even believe them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.12,1:13:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但你绝对还有别的动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's something else going on with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.44,1:13:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,更深层的动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something underneath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.88,1:13:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.80,1:13:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你想对她做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.39,1:13:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经得到你想要的东西 放她走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already got what you wanted! Let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.36,1:13:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,丝尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Syl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.84,1:14:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不 求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.00,1:14:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,放她走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.36,1:14:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,马纳斯 时候到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manas, it's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.08,1:14:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,星际联邦数百年来都在开疆拓土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Federation has pushed the frontier for centuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.68,1:14:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但以后不能了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.76,1:14:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就从这里开始 上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where it begins, Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.68,1:14:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,要挑战未知就要有所觉悟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where the frontier pushes back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.76,1:15:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.12,1:15:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.08,1:15:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须承认 好一招声东击西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to admit, that's a hell of a distraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.40,1:15:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的朋友在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friends are over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.96,1:15:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.16,1:16:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.40,1:16:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,中校 乌胡拉被带走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander. Uhura, they took her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.72,1:16:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,把其他人带到安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the remainder of the crew to safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.52,1:16:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.52,1:16:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 待在圆圈里 - 快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay in the circle. - Come on! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.60,1:17:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有讯号了 斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got them, Mr. Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.72,1:17:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 契科夫 加强讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Mr. Chekov, increase the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.40,1:17:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一次传送20人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna grab them 20 at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.00,1:17:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 - 希望不会出差错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aye. - Let's hope this doesn't get messy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.88,1:17:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Energize!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.61,1:17:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.12,1:17:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.60,1:17:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是来救你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly, I am here to rescue you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.72,1:17:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.68,1:18:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你真开心 小矮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you, wee man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.16,1:19:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,传送器再十秒就充电完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten seconds until the transporter's recharged, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.04,1:19:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等我的讯号 - 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait for my signal. - Doctor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.08,1:19:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,听好 我们不能丢下他们离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, man, we're not leaving without them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.00,1:19:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go. Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.84,1:19:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.96,1:20:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个是你 舰长 快开启信标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're ready for you next, Captain. Just turn on your beacon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.52,1:20:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都传送过去了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, do you have everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.40,1:20:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩你和洁拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir. Everyone except you and Jaylah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.64,1:20:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,开启信标让我们抓住你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the beacon and we'll grab you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.89,1:20:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 你的信标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, your beacon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.96,1:20:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有了 - 传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There it is! - Energize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.04,1:21:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,洁拉 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaylah, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.16,1:21:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.48,1:21:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,下次别再这么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's never do that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.76,1:21:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意 詹姆士·T\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree, James T.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.44,1:21:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.80,1:21:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 他手上的文物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain! This thing he has...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.04,1:21:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,约克镇 他的目标是摧毁约克镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yorktown. He's gonna destroy Yorktown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.36,1:21:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的房子你拿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take my house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.20,1:21:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,让它飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you make it fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.68,1:21:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 这艘船可以发动吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, can you get this thing started?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.80,1:21:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,发动可以 要飞是另外一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Started, yes. Flying, sir, that's a different thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.92,1:21:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这些老船舰是在太空制造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These old vessels, they were built in space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.56,1:21:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,起飞时不适合穿越大气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were never supposed to take off from atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.04,1:21:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,想办法做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.24,1:21:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,它们叫"星舰"是有原因的 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're called starships for a reason, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.16,1:21:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在才跟我讲这个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're telling me this now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.80,1:21:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我不想让你失望 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I didn't want to disappoint you, you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.20,1:21:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,以防万一你回不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in case you didn't make it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.24,1:21:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还真想得周到 斯科特 - 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How thoughtful, Mr. Scott. - Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.40,1:22:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他开始行动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's launching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.68,1:22:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击约克镇可能只是第一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The attack on Yorktown may be just the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.52,1:22:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳拥有这种生物武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Armed with this bio-weapon, he could rid it of all life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.84,1:22:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以摧毁所有生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and use the base's advanced technology{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.32,1:22:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,并利用基地的先进科技 攻击其他联邦星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to attack an untold number of Federation planets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.52,1:22:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也只能硬飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we're just gonna have to get this thing flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.44,1:22:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,引擎无法就这样发动呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannae just jumpstart it, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.64,1:22:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 所有系统已就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! All systems online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.08,1:22:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,二锂室达到70%并继续提高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dilithium chambers at 70% and climbing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.76,1:22:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,主要支持引擎随时可以启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Primary support engines standing by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.60,1:22:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sulu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.12,1:22:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该知道 怎么驾驶吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can, you know, fly this thing, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.28,1:22:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那还用说 长官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kidding me, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.04,1:22:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.04,1:22:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 引擎怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, how we looking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.08,1:23:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能再更好了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready as she'll ever be, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.44,1:23:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我想听的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I like to hear. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.32,1:23:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,老骨头 舰员状况如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones, where are we with the crew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.88,1:23:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有可以用的医疗室就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could use a functioning med-bay,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.56,1:23:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不过大家已经各就各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but otherwise we're secure down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.56,1:23:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁 我们要达到极速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sulu, we have to achieve terminal velocity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.08,1:23:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,才能让稳定器拉起舰身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order for the stabilizers to provide lift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.60,1:23:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定这个下坠高度够吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure this drop is high enough to do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.92,1:23:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,到时就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.96,1:23:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,下令吧 苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call it, Mr. Sulu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.24,1:23:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye-aye, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.76,1:23:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,契科夫 听我口令启动前方稳定器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Chekov, be ready to hit the forward stabilizers full on my mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.88,1:23:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四分之一脉冲 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One quarter impulse. - Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.28,1:24:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,二分之一脉冲 契科夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One half impulse, Mr. Chekov.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.60,1:24:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.16,1:24:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该系上安全带 快 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should belt up. Go on. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.28,1:24:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,慢一点 苏鲁 别让船裂成两半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, Mr. Sulu. Let's not break her in half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.04,1:24:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,该启动了 苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any time, Mr. Sulu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.20,1:25:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就是现在 契科夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Mr. Chekov!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.28,1:26:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有一艘来路不明的船舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}IFF alert on incoming vessel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.32,1:26:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没有在任何频率回报身分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No reply to all-frequency I.D. request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.12,1:26:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,影像放上屏幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.80,1:26:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,红色警戒 红色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red alert! Red alert!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.96,1:26:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看看现在他们多进步了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look how far they've come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.68,1:26:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,请立即前往指定安全区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please proceed to designated safety zones immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.44,1:26:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,请立即前往指定安全区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please proceed to designated safety zones immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.20,1:27:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我接收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm picking up distress signals{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.68,1:27:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,从约克镇发出的全频求救讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from every frequency coming from Yorktown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.40,1:27:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳已经发动攻击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krall's already started his attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.48,1:27:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 我们有什么武器可以用？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scott, what kind of weapons do we have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.88,1:27:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,脉冲相位光炮和空间鱼雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, we have pulsed phase cannons and spatial torpedoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.56,1:27:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 弹药全载\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Lock and load.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.64,1:27:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没用的 你打败不了蜂群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It does not matter. You cannot defeat the bees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.32,1:27:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,或许可以把它们引开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe, uh, maybe we lure them away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.64,1:27:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么帮约克镇争取时间？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we get Yorktown time to get people to safety?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.08,1:27:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,跟蜂群比起来我们是破铜烂铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we are a horse and buggy compared to those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.20,1:27:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,光是自保都很吃力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're barely holding together as it is, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.24,1:27:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 蜂群舰的飞行模式 是由特定几艘决定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, the flight patterns of bees are determined by individual decisions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.16,1:27:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,克劳的蜂群队形过于复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krall's swarm formations are too complex not to rely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.92,1:27:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,必须用统一的机灵感应控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on some form of unified cyberpathic coordination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.32,1:27:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 据我推测 - 史巴克 讲结论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I surmise that if we... - Spock! Skip to the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.04,1:27:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,只要打乱蜂群的方向感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What he's saying is that if we disorient the swarm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.00,1:27:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就能把它们干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can kick its ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.16,1:27:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,完全正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.68,1:27:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 你能把我传送到一艘蜂群舰上吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, can you beam me onto one of those swarm ships?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.68,1:27:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you gone completely mad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.00,1:27:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到底行不行？- 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes or no? - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.36,1:27:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.68,1:27:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.37,1:27:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 我对这些船舰内部有初步了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, my familiarity of the interior of those ships,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.64,1:27:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,比你更适合进行这项外遣任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}however brief, makes me more qualified for this away mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.32,1:28:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克 你伤还没好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, you're still hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.52,1:28:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,她说得没错 史巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.40,1:28:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我对关切表示感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I acknowledge and respect your concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.44,1:28:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,或许让一个熟悉蜂群舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you would feel more confident if I were accompanied by someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.24,1:28:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,和我伤势的人同行 你会比较放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with familiarity of both the ship and my injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.52,1:28:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定会爱死你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna love this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.72,1:28:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.64,1:28:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧 医生 - 慢着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come along, Doctor. - Whoa! Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.92,1:28:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你这忘恩负义的绿血人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, you green-blooded ingrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.68,1:28:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是你出的鬼点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was your idea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.48,1:28:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这是很好的点子 老骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good idea, Bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.80,1:28:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,下次你的腹部被管子刺穿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, next time you have a piece of pipe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.56,1:28:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,叫水电工来救你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stuck in your transverse, call a plumber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.24,1:28:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,记得打乱它们的队形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just make sure you find a way to break those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.88,1:28:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有状况 我会马上把你们传送回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it gets hairy, I'll beam you straight back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.92,1:28:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Energize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.24,1:28:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会很顺利的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna do great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.24,1:28:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 吉姆 我是医生 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Jim, I'm a doctor, not a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.76,1:28:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我上次驾驶这种船舰 最后坠毁了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do realize the last time I flew one of these things we crashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.12,1:28:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以别怪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So don't blame me if we...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.80,1:29:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,撞到东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.48,1:29:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克呼叫富兰克林号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock to Franklin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.92,1:29:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克 请说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, we read you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.08,1:29:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 就目前来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, from what I can ascertain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.44,1:29:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的确通过共享一个神经网络链接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the ships do indeed share a cyberpathic link{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.32,1:29:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,相互沟通 协调行动的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which coordinates their actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.64,1:29:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在传给你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patching it through now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.92,1:29:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what that signal was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.92,1:29:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,它们不是在干扰我们 而是互相交谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weren't jamming us, they were talking to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.32,1:29:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样可以让他们不要说话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how do we get them to stop talking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.60,1:29:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,用传送器进行电磁聚焦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about electromagnetic focusing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.44,1:29:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,扰乱它们的网络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could use the transporters, disrupt their network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.16,1:29:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,焦点可能会太明确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The focus might be too specific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.16,1:29:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,若我们在蜂群中植入干扰讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we could plant some sort of disruptive communication signal inside the swarm,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.12,1:29:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,或许就能破坏它们的协调能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it might adversely affect their capacity to coordinate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.28,1:29:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,必须透过它们预想不到的频率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would have to be at a frequency they will not anticipate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.92,1:29:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以引发连锁反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could cause a chain reaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.12,1:29:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁整个蜂群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that would wipe out the whole swarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.60,1:29:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的封闭网络可能会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, a closed network like that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.00,1:29:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易受到特高频影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}might be susceptible to very high frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.96,1:29:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,特高频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}VHF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.64,1:29:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,无线电 我们可以利用舰上广播 盖过它们的连结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Radio. We can broadcast something from the ship to drown out their link.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.16,1:29:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要很吵又令人分心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something loud and distracting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.84,1:29:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,很吵又令人分心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loud and distracting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.64,1:29:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有这个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got just the thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.48,1:29:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别弄坏我的音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not break my music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.36,1:29:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,才不会 我要帮你升级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break it? You're getting an upgrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.48,1:30:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂群舰再60秒就要冲进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swarm ships are 60 seconds from breaking through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.68,1:30:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要把特高频输出转到多相扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've just got to reconfigure the VHF output into a multiphasic sweep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.12,1:30:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.76,1:30:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,让她来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.16,1:30:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.56,1:30:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就好了 很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, see? Simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.52,1:30:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 舰长 可以广播了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Captain, we're ready to broadcast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.20,1:30:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,讯号传不远 我们必须靠近一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the signal won't travel far. We have to get closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.92,1:30:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多靠近？- 非常近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How close? - Very.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.16,1:30:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,拦截路线 苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intercept course, Mr. Sulu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.28,1:30:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,到蜂群中间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put us right in the middle of that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.72,1:30:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.24,1:30:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我的老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.00,1:31:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂群舰掉头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The swarm ships are doubling back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.72,1:31:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,它们正在形成一波攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are forming an attack wave, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.56,1:31:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,吸引到它们的注意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we got their attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.04,1:31:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住 苏鲁 大家采取安全姿势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold steady, Mr. Sulu. Brace yourselves, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.12,1:31:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,史巴克 准备离开蜂群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, stand by to drop out of formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.96,1:31:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯科特 准备好了没？- 好了 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Scotty, you all cued up back there? - Aye, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.20,1:31:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,准备以57.7MHz广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to broadcast at 577 megahertz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.76,1:31:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,选好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made your choice, lassie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.88,1:31:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,节拍和吼叫都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the beat and shouting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.00,1:31:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,来点音乐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make some noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.04,1:31:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.16,1:32:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,开快点 医生 不然 我们会被它们衰变的轨道吞噬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster, Doctor. We risk being consumed by their trajectorial decay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.28,1:32:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我开车你别吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn backseat driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.12,1:32:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快闪 医生 - 我有看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Evade, Doctor! - I see it, I see it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.00,1:32:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那是古典乐吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that classical music?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.00,1:32:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来是 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Doctor, it would seem to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.64,1:32:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,乌胡拉上尉 通知约克镇也用这个频率广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Uhura, make sure Yorktown has the frequency to broadcast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.76,1:32:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我们取得了干扰频率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we now have the disruption frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.04,1:32:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,马上广播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Broadcast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.20,1:33:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们没事吧 史巴克？- 没事 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You two all right, Spock? - We are fine, Captain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.92,1:33:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但仍有三艘船舰驶进了约克镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there are still three ships heading into Yorktown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.28,1:33:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是克劳 跟紧他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's got to be Krall. Keep on him, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.04,1:33:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,尽全力阻止他使用武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do whatever it takes to stop him from using that weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.32,1:33:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的房子要垮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My house is breaking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.44,1:33:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去了舰体装甲极性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost the polarization of the hull plating!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.92,1:33:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把二锂室的动力重新布线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can reroute the power from the dilithium chambers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.16,1:33:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.28,1:33:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你 洁拉 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I need you, Jaylah. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.64,1:34:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟丢了 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not lose them, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.08,1:34:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你随时跟我换位子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're more than welcome to switch places with me, Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.60,1:34:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 要一次拦截三艘船舰是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, intercepting all three ships is an impossibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.28,1:34:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,给我约克镇的示意图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me a schematic of Yorktown!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.28,1:34:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那里 约克镇总部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There! Yorktown headquarters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.44,1:34:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,契科夫 对中央广场进行生物扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Chekov, can you do a bioscan of Central Plaza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.40,1:34:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正在疏散人群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are clearing civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.12,1:34:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,老骨头 你们前方是中央广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones, there's a city plaza coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.12,1:35:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,把克劳引过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta make sure Krall heads for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.28,1:35:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 做就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Just do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.60,1:35:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁 升上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sulu, get us up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.12,1:35:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,大家坐稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold onto something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.20,1:36:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干得好 老骨头 - 谢了 吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Great work, Bones. - Thanks, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.68,1:36:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我只需要想办法降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I've just got to figure out how to land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.80,1:36:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 撞击造成舰身三处破损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I have three hull breaches from the impact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.52,1:36:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,分别在三号甲板 货物舱和引擎室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deck 3, the cargo bay, and the engine room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.92,1:36:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁 契科夫 检查货物舱和三号甲板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Sulu, Chekov, check the cargo bay and Deck 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.68,1:36:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须确认武器状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need confirmation that the weapon has been neutralized{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.84,1:36:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,以及克劳是否死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Krall is dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.80,1:36:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.76,1:37:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是克劳干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Krall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.08,1:37:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们亲眼目睹过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've seen him do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.60,1:37:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这种类似能量转移会改变他的外貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's some kind of energy transference. It physically changes him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.12,1:37:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定还在舰上 不然早就被发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must still be onboard. We would have seen him leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.40,1:37:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁 联络约克镇安全部 封锁舰上所有出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sulu, contact Yorktown security and lock down the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.82,1:37:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.84,1:37:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,开疆拓土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push the frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.20,1:37:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about damn time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.96,1:37:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？- 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you ready? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.12,1:37:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, baby, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.20,1:37:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 时间到了 - 开疆拓土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's about damn time. - Push the frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.60,1:37:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.96,1:37:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 时间到了 - 开疆拓土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's about damn time. - Push the frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.80,1:38:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 时间到了 - 开疆拓土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's about damn time. - Push the frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.48,1:38:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 时间到了 - 开疆拓土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's about damn time. - Push the frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.16,1:38:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 时间到了 - 开疆拓土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's about damn time. - Push the frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.68,1:38:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,拓土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.48,1:38:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,拓土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.00,1:38:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.32,1:38:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 进入富兰克林号的数据库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, I need you to link into the Franklin database.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.56,1:38:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,查询巴尔萨泽·爱迪生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find out what you can about Balthazar Edison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.96,1:38:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 富兰克林号的舰长？- 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The captai n of the Franklin? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.84,1:38:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他早就死了 - 不 他早死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, he'll be long dead. - No. He's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.96,1:38:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么 但爱迪生就是克劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how, but Edison is Krall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.88,1:38:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么发现？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you find?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.96,1:38:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他的纪录回溯到星际联邦成立之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His record goes back way before the Federation even existed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.52,1:38:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他是地球联合军事指挥部的少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a major in the United Earth Military Assault{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.52,1:38:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,参加过多次地外战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Command Operation. A lot of off-world combat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.76,1:38:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.84,1:38:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 长官 战功显赫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir. And a pretty good one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.04,1:39:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,军事指挥部解散后 他的军人生涯也画下句点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His military service came to an end when MACO was disbanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.92,1:39:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 因为星际联邦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why, what happened? - The Federation, sir. Starfleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.32,1:39:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是军事机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not a military agency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.52,1:39:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,星联让他当富兰克林号舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made him a captain and gave him the Franklin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.48,1:39:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开启他的日志 - 好的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Scotty, bring up his logs. - Aye, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.88,1:39:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 舰长日志 - 跳到最后一篇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain's Log... - Last entry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.44,1:39:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长日志 我已经记不得星历了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's Log... I don't remember the stardate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.88,1:39:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所有求救讯号都没有响应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All distress calls unanswered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.64,1:39:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所有舰员当中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of the crew,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.64,1:39:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,只有三名还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only three remain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.64,1:39:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't allow it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.72,1:39:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的原生种族 很久之前遗弃了这颗星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The indigenous race abandoned this planet long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.56,1:39:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们留下了精密的采矿设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They left behind sophisticated mining equipment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.04,1:39:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,和一群听人使唤的矿工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a drone workforce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.40,1:39:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拥有某种科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have some sort of technology{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.32,1:39:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可以延续生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that prolongs life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.12,1:39:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我会不顾一切救我和我的舰员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will do whatever it takes for me and my crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.76,1:39:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,星际联邦根本不在乎我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Federation do not care about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.72,1:40:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可能永远不会再看到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll probably never see me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.56,1:40:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果遇到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you do,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.60,1:40:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走着瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.64,1:40:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么还没有使用武器？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why has he not used his weapon yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.68,1:40:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他想找一个能造成最大破坏的地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause he wants to find somewhere to inflict maximum damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.44,1:40:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要一个传播系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs a distribution system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.44,1:40:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这里必须让空气流通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have to circulate air here, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.84,1:40:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 核心有个大气调节器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir. There's an atmospheric regulator at the core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.53,1:40:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,上尉 联络约克镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, contact Yorktown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.84,1:40:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在找到克劳之前别开调节器 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make sure they shut it down until we find Krall - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.44,1:40:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他要怎么进入核心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would he access the core?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.96,1:40:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 在空间站的重力结合点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, well, there's a maintenance tower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.92,1:40:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有个维修塔 那是唯一的路径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the station's gravitational nexus. That's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.48,1:40:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 快去确保调节器是关的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, you get over there. Make sure it gets shut down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.00,1:40:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小姑娘 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lassie, you're with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.48,1:40:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大气调节器是关不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, this thing is impossible to shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.84,1:40:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.96,1:40:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,试试看就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll see about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.08,1:41:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 为什么调节器还开着？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scott, why is that thing still on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.16,1:41:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在努力 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're working on it, sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.24,1:41:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但你该明白我要突破很多安全协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but as you can imagine there's a lot of safety protocols{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.44,1:41:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一大堆的东西 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}surrounding the thing that, you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.96,1:41:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 毕竟关系到所有人的性命 - 想想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- keeps everybody alive. - Figure something out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.12,1:41:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.20,1:41:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你愈接近中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gravity's gonna get a bit screwy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.96,1:41:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,重力的作用就越大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the closer you get to the center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.04,1:41:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,也许 我们该扫描结构图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should scan the operational schematics,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.60,1:41:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看有没有后门 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- see if there's a back door. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.85,1:41:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,小姑娘 我需要你盯着屏幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lassie, I'm gonna need your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.08,1:41:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.80,1:41:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那个星球发生了什么事 爱迪生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you out there, Edison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.00,1:41:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,爱迪生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.56,1:41:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须说 柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to say, Kirk,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.20,1:41:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想念原本的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've missed being me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.04,1:41:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去了自我 但生存有了目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost ourselves but gained a purpose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.04,1:42:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有一种方法可以让星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A means to bring the galaxy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.60,1:42:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,陷入斗争 使人类变强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back to the struggle that made humanity strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.20,1:42:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你低估了人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you underestimate humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.16,1:42:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我为人类奋战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fought for humanity!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.56,1:42:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,几百万人死于辛地与罗慕兰之战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost millions to the Xindi and Romulan Wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.28,1:42:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,结果呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.88,1:42:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,联邦竟然要我当舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the Federation to sit me in a captain's chair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.72,1:42:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,跟敌人和平共存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and break bread with the enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.92,1:42:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们改变了 不这样不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We change. We have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.20,1:42:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,否则一辈子都得打一样的仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or we spend the rest of our lives fighting the same battles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.64,1:43:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.60,1:43:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你回不去调节器那边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way you can make it back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.72,1:43:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.12,1:43:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你一样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, like you did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.96,1:43:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我读了你的日志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read your ship's log,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.48,1:43:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆士·T·柯克舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain James T. Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.96,1:43:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我至少知道自己是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least I know what I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.00,1:43:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是一名军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.68,1:43:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你打赢了战争 爱迪生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won the war, Edison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.92,1:43:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,为我们带来和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave us peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.08,1:43:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.44,1:43:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不存在于我生活的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is not what I was born into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.16,1:43:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.28,1:43:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在利用重力滑流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, he's using the gravitational slipstream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.48,1:43:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,尝试回到中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to carry him back to the center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.24,1:44:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.16,1:44:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 武器在核心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that? - The weapon's in the chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.80,1:44:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长 我们必须马上关闭系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we have to stop the processor now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.56,1:44:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,否则约克镇所有人都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or everything breathing in Yorktown is dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.20,1:44:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你阻止不了它的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.36,1:45:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.76,1:45:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我宁愿因为拯救生命而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better to die saving lives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.44,1:45:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也不要活着杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than to live with taking them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.60,1:45:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我生活的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I was born into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.10,1:45:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有个密封的施工舱口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a sealed construction hatch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.09,1:45:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,打开通风口就能把武器排放到太空中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that will let you vent the weapon into space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.45,1:45:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以从这里解锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we can override the locks from up here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.08,1:45:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但你必须自己开启舱口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you will have to activate the hatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.56,1:45:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,按个按钮就行了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I just hit a button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.88,1:45:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,它不是按钮 它是个位于白色面板之下的银色拉杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a button, sir. It's a silver lever under a white panel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.08,1:45:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找到了 - 总共有四个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got it! - And there's four of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.84,1:45:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,开启舱口之后 马上离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you've primed the hatch,you'll have to exit the chamber immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.00,1:45:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果系统开始循环而舱口是开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the hatch is open when the processor cycles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.96,1:45:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你会被吸到外层空间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're in it, you're gonna get sucked into space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.08,1:45:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果舱口没打开呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens if the hatch isn't open?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.00,1:45:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你会被吸到大风扇里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get sucked into a big fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.92,1:45:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,跟武器一起 没人能活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the weapon, and we all die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.56,1:45:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 吉姆 你会来不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Jim, you won't make it out in time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.61,1:45:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,通风口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.36,1:46:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开 詹姆士·T\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of there, James T.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.04,1:46:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 最后一个舱口打不开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, the last hatch won't open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.68,1:46:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.92,1:46:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快 没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work fast, Captain, time's running out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.96,1:46:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他来不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.80,1:46:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.84,1:46:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,进入手动操控模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manual override engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.36,1:47:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有你该怎么办 史巴克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would I do without you, Spock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.72,1:48:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,星际联邦数十年来一直当他是英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For decades the Federation taught that he was a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.40,1:48:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只能说他的对错不是我们能评判的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess time will judge us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.44,1:48:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是迷失了自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just got lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.40,1:48:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你拯救了整个基地 柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved this entire base, Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.80,1:48:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,数百万条性命 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millions of souls. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.08,1:48:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这不只是我的功劳 从来都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't just me. It never is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.40,1:48:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不用说 中将职位是你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Needless to say, the position of Vice Admiral is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.16,1:48:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人比你更有资格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one deserves it more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.52,1:48:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,中将是不上星舰的 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vice Admirals don't fly, do they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.92,1:48:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. They don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.52,1:48:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我无意冒犯 不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no offense, ma'am,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.92,1:48:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这样有什么好玩的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but where's the fun in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.68,1:49:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本没要求减少任务时间？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't even try to get our time out here reduced?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.20,1:49:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛减少？老骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I get it reduced?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.28,1:49:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在知道穿越星云的路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones, we know our way through the nebula now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.08,1:49:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,想象一下会有什么新发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you imagine what we'll find!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.60,1:49:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一心想置我们于死地的外星恶霸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alien despots hell-bent on killing us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.08,1:50:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,致命的太空病毒和细菌？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deadly space-borne viruses and bacteria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.68,1:50:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,无法理解的宇宙异常现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incomprehensible cosmic anomalies that could{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.08,1:50:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们一瞬间灰飞烟灭？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wipe us out in an instant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.72,1:50:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be so much fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.00,1:50:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.32,1:50:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不是要去喝一杯吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we were gonna get a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.04,1:50:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你要我保持低调 不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you told me to keep it under wraps, but, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.64,1:50:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,生日快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy Birthday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.92,1:50:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,敏感先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sensitive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.28,1:50:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来 给你 - 谢了 斯科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you go, laddie. - Thanks, Scotty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.44,1:50:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我们举杯敬詹姆士·T·柯克舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, raise a glass to Captain James T. Kirk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.80,1:50:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 柯克舰长 - 谢谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain Kirk! - Thanks, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.04,1:50:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 敬企业号 - 敬企业号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To the Enterprise. - To the Enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.64,1:50:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.64,1:50:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不在的朋友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to absent friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.16,1:50:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 敬他们 - 干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here's to that. - Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.20,1:50:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,派对开始啰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's get this party started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.56,1:50:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,轮到谁了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose round is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.72,1:50:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,给我三杯罗慕兰麦芽酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I get three, uh, Romulan ales for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.96,1:50:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你要写任务报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you had to finish your mission report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.24,1:50:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我的确要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.56,1:50:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但我认为跟你一起参加活动更有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I thought it would be more pleasing to engage with you socially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.00,1:51:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很老派的浪漫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You old romantic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.96,1:51:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道苏格兰威士忌其实是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know that scotch was actually invented{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.76,1:51:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,一名俄罗斯老太太发明的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by a little old lady in Russia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.24,1:51:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦？没有多少人知道 - 失陪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Huh? Not many people know. - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.12,1:51:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你一个人喝了这么多？真厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, did you drink all those yourself? I'm impressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.68,1:51:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有人说这样可以让我放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone said it will take my edge off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.52,1:51:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是不能放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My edge is still not off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.04,1:51:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能有帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, well, maybe this will help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.76,1:51:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,舰长做了一些安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain pulled a few strings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.20,1:51:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是星舰学院的入学许可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is acceptance into Starfleet Academy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.29,1:51:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想要的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.00,1:51:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有超多规定 不要每条都遵守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have a lot of rules. Don't listen to them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.04,1:51:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要穿制服吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will I have to wear that uniform?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.12,1:51:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afraid so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.88,1:51:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 昆塞尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Keenser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.24,1:51:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,凯文 你还是不穿裤子啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin. Still not wearing pants, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.28,1:51:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说史巴克大使的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard about Ambassador Spock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.12,1:52:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你上次在电梯里就是想跟我讲这个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you wanted to mention that time in the turbolift?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.48,1:52:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More or less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.08,1:52:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你和派瑞丝准将的会面 进行得很顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust your meeting with Commodore Paris went well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.52,1:52:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More or less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.60,1:52:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是真的很想马上出航吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really want to head back out there, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.84,1:52:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太空 人类的终极疆界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Space, the final frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.04,1:53:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是星舰企业号的旅程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are the voyages of the Starship...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.28,1:53:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,它的任务是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... Enterprise. Its continuing mission...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.52,1:53:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为了探索陌生的新世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To explore strange new worlds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.04,1:53:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找新生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To seek out new life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.88,1:53:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,和新文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And new civilizations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.96,1:53:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,勇敢航向人类足迹从未踏至的领域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To boldly go where no one has gone before.{\r}
